WEBVTT

00:00:01.037 --> 00:00:04.022
<v Guide>The bridge is out,
so we take the river path tonight.

00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:07.011
<v Scout>Then we leave now,
before the lanterns burn down.

00:00:07.539 --> 00:00:11.007
<v Guide>Pack light, keep the map dry,
and stay close to me.

00:00:12.607 --> 00:00:14.472
<v Sprite>Psst! Over here. The gate is open!
